  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      220.15,
      203.69,
      397.17,
      251.03
    ],
    "text": "(ii)who shows sufficient proof of anyprescribed investment through theAccount within Sri Lanka equivalentto the minimum sum,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      220.15,
      263.69,
      397.18,
      299.03
    ],
    "text": "shall be eligible for a resident visa in Sri Lankafor a maximum period of ten years from thedate of opening the Account;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      196.87,
      311.69,
      397.18,
      395.03
    ],
    "text": "(b)(i)the spouse of the Account holder shallbe entitled to a resident visa in Sri Lankaif in addition to the minimum sum, anadditional sum of not less than UnitedStates Dollars three hundred thousandor its equivalent is deposited into suchAccount;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      220.15,
      407.69,
      397.18,
      455.03
    ],
    "text": "(ii)the spouse of the Account holder shallbe entitled to a resident visa only duringthe validity of the Account holder\u2019sresident visa obtained under this Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.71,
      467.69,
      397.2,
      539.03
    ],
    "text": "(c)the minor children of such Account holdershall be entitled to a resident visa in Sri Lankaduring the validity of the Account holder\u2019sresident visa obtained under this Act or untilthe age of eighteen years, whichever shallprecede.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      551.69,
      397.18,
      575.03
    ],
    "text": "(2) An Account holder shall maintain such Account forthe duration of the resident visa.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      587.69,
      397.2,
      623.03
    ],
    "text": "(3) The Minister may prescribe by regulations thecategories of investments that an Account holder may investin through the Account for the purposes of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      635.69,
      397.18,
      671.03
    ],
    "text": "(4) An Account holder shall not be entitled to engage inany paid employment without a working visa granted forsuch purpose according to written law.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      231.21,
      167.17,
      402.89,
      178.24
    ],
    "text": "3Special Deposit Account",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      204.17,
      401.86,
      227.75
    ],
    "text": "(5) Every Account holder shall be free from any tax or anyother levies\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      241.01,
      401.9,
      264.71
    ],
    "text": "(a)on income or profit derived from outside Sri Lanka;and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      277.97,
      401.87,
      301.55
    ],
    "text": "(b)on interest on income accrued or capital in theAccount,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      314.81,
      401.9,
      350.75
    ],
    "text": "under the Inland Revenue Act, No. 10 of 2006, subject to anyadministrative or operational levy as may be determined bythe Central Bank.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.01,
      401.86,
      399.95
    ],
    "text": "(6) The provisions of the Exchange Control Act, No. 39of 1973 on the limits on remittances into Sri Lanka shall notapply in respect of any Account holder under this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      413.21,
      401.91,
      449.15
    ],
    "text": "(7) Strict confidentiality shall be maintained at all timesexcept when required by any written law, by a court or by theCentral Bank.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      462.41,
      401.88,
      510.71
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The provisions of the Immigrants and EmigrantsAct, No. 20 of 1948 shall apply in respect of the issuing,cancelling or amending any visa granted for the purposes ofthis Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      523.97,
      401.87,
      547.55
    ],
    "text": "(2) In addition to subsection (1), a visa shall be deemed tobe cancelled upon\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      560.81,
      329.14,
      572.15
    ],
    "text": "(a)the death of the Account holder;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      585.41,
      388.31,
      596.75
    ],
    "text": "(b)the Account holder being suspected of treason;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      610.01,
      401.88,
      645.95
    ],
    "text": "(c)subject to subsection (3), the failure of the Accountholder to maintain the minimum sum specified underthis Act;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      659.21,
      310.3,
      670.55
    ],
